TI  - Complete Genome Sequencing of the Novel Pseudomonas aeruginosa Phage UF_RH1.
AB  - Here, we present the genome sequence of a novel Pseudomonas aeruginosa bacteriophage called UF_RH1. This lytic phage has a genome size of 42,567 bp and is classified as a member of the Siphoviridae family and the Septimatrevirus genus. UF_RH1 shares genetic similarities with Stenotrophomonas phage vB_SmaS-DLP_2.
