AB  - We report the genome sequence of a lytic phage named UF_RH6, which infects Pseudomonas aeruginosa. This phage was isolated from a respiratory secretion sample from a patient with pulmonary P. aeruginosa. UF_RH6 belongs to the family Caudoviricetes and the genus Samunavirus. Its genome is 94,715 bp in length and encodes 130 proteins.
