AB  - We describe four Phikmvirus Pseudomonas phages isolated from sewage samples in Kenya: vB_PaePA01phi1_RS1, vB_PaePA10145Phi1_RS1, vB_PaePA8132phi1_PS3, and vB_PaePA10145phi1_HR2. Their genomes range from 43,723 to 45,485 bp with 62.24%-62.37% GC content and 65-68 coding sequences.
